B.Ud=new A.j6("Metrics","Track accounts researched, prospects added, touches, follow-ups, replies, positive interest, qualified opportunities, meetings booked/held, objections, one experiment, and next actions.","Weekly Review")
B.Ub=new A.j6("Pipeline","Company \xb7 website \xb7 lane \xb7 contact \xb7 role \xb7 contact route \xb7 fit score \xb7 priority \xb7 status \xb7 first touch \xb7 last touch \xb7 next action \xb7 next-action date \xb7 source URL \xb7 reply/outcome \xb7 notes.","Acquisition Tracker Fields")
B.Ui=new A.j6("Delivery","Commercial: scope, compensation, payment timing, duration.\nOffer/market: product, ICP, exclusions, geography, target roles, qualification rule.\nBoundaries: approved claims, pricing/technical escalation, authority limits.\nTools: CRM, dialer, email, calendar, lead source, reporting location.\nWorkflow: daily expectation, follow-up cadence, handoff, reporting, response-time expectations.","Client Onboarding Checklist")
